---
title: Proposed Forge game - worker support and Rust tick handoff
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Main JS thread
    participant R as Rust main thread
    participant W as JS support worker
    participant J as Replay journal
    M->>R: Request level
    R->>W: Request cooked assets with generation
    W->>W: Fetch, hash, or delegate to Rust support outside tick
    W-->>R: Return bytes or failure with generation
    Note over R,W: Keep active room on required failure.<br/>Draw primitives for missing optional art.
    R->>R: Reject stale result or validate and stage candidate
    M->>R: Send ordered input edges and frame timing
    R->>R: Run bounded fixed ticks
    R->>J: Retain old input segment and transition
    R->>R: Activate ready candidate at tick boundary
    R-->>M: Publish snapshot and pose for one epoch and tick
    Note over M,R: Main JS draws the frame.<br/>Support worker may relay the committed view.
